<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>MASTER BETA — Mastering Console</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lamejs@1.2.0/lame.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#07090e;--panel:#0e1420;--panel2:#121a29;--line:#1d2739;--line2:#2a3750;--txt:#e8eef7;--mut:#8fa0b5;--dim:#5d6d84;--acc:#38e1ff;--acc2:#a78bfa;--good:#3ddc97;--warn:#ffc857;--bad:#ff6b7a;--lcd:#ffd9a0;--mono:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}
html{overflow-x:clip;scrollbar-color:#2a3750 #0a0f18}
body{overflow-x:clip;max-width:100vw}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px;height:10px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:#0a0f18}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#2a3750;border-radius:5px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:#39496b}
::-webkit-scrollbar-corner{background:#0a0f18}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:radial-gradient(1200px 550px at 75% -10%,#0f1a2e 0%,transparent 60%),var(--bg);color:var(--txt);font:12px/1.45 'Sora',system-ui,sans-serif;padding-bottom:26px}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer}input,select,textarea{font-family:inherit}
header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.logo{width:29px;height:29px;border-radius:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--acc),var(--acc2));box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(56,225,255,.35)}
.brand b{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:2.5px}.brand small{display:block;color:var(--dim);font-size:9.5px}
.hbadge{font:600 9.5px/1 var(--mono);color:var(--mut);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;padding:6px 9px}
#bootStat{margin-left:auto}
#btnTopLoad,#btnManual{font-size:10.5px;padding:7px 13px;white-space:nowrap}
#dropWrap{max-width:700px;margin:44px auto 0;padding:0 18px;text-align:center}
#dropZone{border:2px dashed #2b3a55;border-radius:18px;padding:42px 26px;cursor:pointer;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(56,225,255,.04),rgba(167,139,250,.03));transition:.25s}
#dropZone:hover,#dropZone.drag{border-color:var(--acc);box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(56,225,255,.06)}
.dzIcon{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:7px}
#dropZone h2{font-size:17.5px;margin-bottom:5px}#dropZone p{color:var(--mut);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
.btn{border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 18px;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;transition:.18s}
.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--acc),var(--acc2));color:#06121c;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(56,225,255,.3)}
.btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn-primary:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none;box-shadow:none}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--txt);border:1px solid var(--line2)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--acc);color:var(--acc)}
.btn-ghost:disabled{opacity:.3;cursor:not-allowed}
.feat{display:flex;gap:7px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:13px}
.feat span{font:600 9.5px/1 var(--mono);color:var(--dim);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 9px;border-radius:99px}
#app{max-width:1720px;margin:0 auto;padding:10px 13px;overflow-x:clip}[hidden]{display:none!important}
.trackbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel2),var(--panel));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:8px 12px;margin-bottom:9px}
.tname{font-weight:700;font-size:13px;max-width:360px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.tsub{color:var(--dim);font:9.5px var(--mono)}
.tchips{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.chip{font:600 9.5px/1 var(--mono);padding:6px 8px;border-radius:7px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--mut)}
.chip.bad{color:var(--bad);border-color:rgba(255,107,122,.4)}.chip.good{color:var(--good);border-color:rgba(61,220,151,.35)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px minmax(0,1fr) 700px;gap:11px;align-items:stretch;min-width:0}
.colwrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}
.colwrap>*{flex:none}
.colwrap>*:last-child{flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0}
.card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel2),var(--panel));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:10px;margin-bottom:9px}
.card h3{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mut);margin-bottom:7px}
.pgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5px}
.pchip{border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 7px;text-align:left;transition:.15s;color:var(--txt)}
.pchip b{display:block;font-size:10px;margin-bottom:1px}.pchip small{font-size:8.5px;color:var(--dim);display:block}
.pchip.on{border-color:var(--acc);background:rgba(56,225,255,.08)}.pchip.on b{color:var(--acc)}
.rcol{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}
.console{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:530px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.012) 0 2px,transparent 2px 4px),linear-gradient(180deg,#16203250,#0d1522 60%),#101a2a;border:1px solid #24334f;border-radius:12px;padding:8px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05),0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.4);overflow:hidden}
.tabview{flex:1;min-height:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px;align-items:stretch;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:clip;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#2a3750 #0a0f18;padding-right:3px}
.tabview::-webkit-scrollbar{width:6px}
.pan{position:relative;border:1px solid #1c2942;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#111a2b,#0e1624);padding:7px 7px 9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}
.pan::before,.pan::after{content:'';position:absolute;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%,#4a5b7d,#18233a 75%)}
.pan::before{top:3px;left:3px}.pan::after{bottom:3px;right:3px}
.pan.wide{grid-column:1/-1}
.panhead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font:700 9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:2px;color:#8fa0b5;margin:0 4px 5px}
.panhead:before,.panhead:after{content:'';height:1px;background:#22304a;flex:1}
.pled{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#1b2740;border:1px solid #263350;flex:none}
.pled.lit{background:var(--good);border-color:var(--good);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--good)}
.krow{display:grid;gap:4px;margin:3px 0;justify-items:center;align-items:end}
.krow.k4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
.krow.flex{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}
.kn{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;user-select:none;cursor:ns-resize;touch-action:none;padding:1px 0;width:100%;min-width:0}
.kn svg{width:44px;height:44px;display:block}
.kt{fill:none;stroke:#1e2c46;stroke-width:3;stroke-linecap:round}
.kv{fill:none;stroke:var(--acc);stroke-width:3;stroke-linecap:round;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 2.5px rgba(56,225,255,.7))}
.kf{fill:#151f33;stroke:#2a3750;stroke-width:1.2}
.kgl{fill:rgba(255,255,255,.07)}
.kr rect{fill:#e8f6ff;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 1.5px rgba(56,225,255,.8))}
.ktx{font:600 8.5px var(--mono);color:var(--lcd);margin-top:1px;min-height:10px;white-space:nowrap}
.klb{font:700 7.5px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.5px;color:#5d6d84;margin-top:1px;white-space:nowrap;text-align:center}
/* mic buttons */
.microw{display:flex;gap:4px;margin:3px 2px 5px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.micbtn{flex:1;min-width:44px;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--mut);border-radius:7px;padding:7px 2px 6px;font:700 8px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.4px;transition:.15s;position:relative}
.micbtn:hover{border-color:var(--good);color:var(--good)}
.micbtn.on{border-color:var(--good);color:var(--good);background:rgba(61,220,151,.1);box-shadow:0 0 7px rgba(61,220,151,.3)}
.micbtn small{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:6px;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.2px;margin-top:1px}
.micbtn.on small{color:#9fe8c8}
.hs{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;user-select:none;cursor:ew-resize;touch-action:none;padding:2px 0 1px;width:100%;min-width:0}
.hst{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:160px;height:11px;margin-top:2px;background:#0a0f18;border:1px solid #22304a;border-radius:5px;box-shadow:inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
.hsf{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--acc),var(--acc2));border-radius:4px 0 0 4px}
.hsh{position:absolute;top:-3px;width:10px;height:15px;border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#44557a,#1d2942);border:1px solid #4a5b7d;box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.hsw{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;padding:1px 0}
.swl{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#1b2740;border:1px solid #263350;margin-bottom:3px;transition:.2s}
.hsw.on .swl{background:var(--good);border-color:var(--good);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--good)}
.swb{width:16px;height:26px;background:#0a0f18;border:1px solid #2a3750;border-radius:7px;position:relative;box-shadow:inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
.swb i{position:absolute;left:2px;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;top:12px;transition:.15s;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#4a5b7d,#26365a)}
.hsw.on .swb i{top:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#38e1ff,#a78bfa)}
.texbtn{flex:1;min-width:50px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--mut);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 2px 5px;font:700 8px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.6px;transition:.15s}
.texbtn svg{width:21px;height:21px;display:block}
.texbtn.on{border-color:var(--acc2);color:var(--acc2);background:rgba(167,139,250,.12);box-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(167,139,250,.25)}
.grm{margin-top:6px;padding:6px 8px;background:#0a0f18;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:7px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
.grm .grhdr{font:700 7.5px var(--mono);letter-spacing:1.5px;color:var(--dim);display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.grm .grhdr .mode{color:var(--acc)}
.grrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font:600 8.5px var(--mono);color:var(--dim)}
.grrow .lbl{width:52px;flex:none}
.grbar{height:9px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#131c2e 0 8px,#0d1524 8px 10px);border:1px solid #263350;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;flex:1}
.grbar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ffc857,#ff6b7a)}
.grrow .num{width:48px;text-align:right;color:var(--warn)}
.assistrow{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;padding:0 3px}
.assistrow .btn{white-space:nowrap;flex:none;padding:8px 12px;font-size:10.5px}
#assistOut{font:600 8px var(--mono);color:var(--lcd);line-height:1.65;flex:1;min-width:0;opacity:.92}
#depthTxt{font:600 7.5px var(--mono);color:var(--dim);margin-top:5px;line-height:1.7;white-space:pre-line}
.wmnote{font-size:8px;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.5;margin-top:5px}
#tbCv{width:100%;height:64px;display:block;border-radius:6px;background:#0a0f18;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.tabbar{flex:none;display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:7px;padding-top:7px;border-top:1px solid #24334f}
.tab{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#1a2740,#121a2b);border:1px solid #2a3750;border-radius:8px;color:#8fa0b5;padding:8px 7px;font:700 9.5px var(--mono);letter-spacing:1.5px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;transition:.15s}
.tab:hover{border-color:var(--acc)}
.tab.on{color:#07131d;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#38e1ff,#a78bfa);border-color:transparent}
.tled{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#0a0f18;opacity:.5}
.tled.lit{background:var(--good);box-shadow:0 0 5px var(--good);opacity:1!important}
select,input[type=text],textarea{width:100%;background:#0a0f18;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:7px;color:var(--txt);padding:5px 7px;font-size:10.5px;outline:none}
select:focus,input:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:var(--acc)}
textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:30px}
.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:5px}.fgrid .full{grid-column:span 2}
.fgrid label{font-size:7.5px;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.4px;text-transform:uppercase;display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
#eqCanvas{width:100%;height:180px;display:block;border-radius:8px;background:#0a0f18;border:1px solid var(--line);cursor:crosshair;touch-action:none}
#eqTip{font:9.5px var(--mono);color:var(--dim);margin-top:4px;min-height:12px}#eqTip b{color:var(--acc)}
.eqbar{display:flex;gap:9px;margin-top:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start}
.bands{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.bchip{font:700 9.5px var(--mono);padding:5px 7px;border-radius:7px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);color:var(--mut)}
.bchip.on{border-color:var(--acc);color:var(--acc);background:rgba(56,225,255,.08)}
.bchip.mt{color:var(--bad)}
.bctl{flex:1;min-width:220px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:33px 1fr 42px 44px;gap:4px 6px;align-items:center;font-size:9.5px;color:var(--mut)}
.bctl select{grid-column:1/-1}
.bctl .val{font:600 8.5px var(--mono);color:var(--lcd);text-align:right}
.lbtn{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--mut);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 6px;font-weight:700;font-size:8.5px;transition:.15s}
.lbtn.on{border-color:var(--warn);color:var(--warn);background:rgba(255,200,87,.08)}
input[type=range]{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:4px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--acc),var(--acc2));outline:none;cursor:pointer}
input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#dff6ff;border:2px solid var(--acc);box-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(56,225,255,.6)}
.transport{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px}
#btnPlay{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;border:0;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--acc),var(--acc2));color:#06121c;font-size:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(56,225,255,.35)}
#btnPlay:hover{transform:scale(1.06)}
.seg{display:flex;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}
.seg button{background:transparent;border:0;color:var(--mut);padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:10px}
.seg button.on{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--acc),var(--acc2));color:#07131d}
.seg button:disabled{opacity:.3;cursor:not-allowed}
#liveBadge{font:600 8.5px/1.2 var(--mono);color:var(--warn);border:1px dashed rgba(255,200,87,.45);padding:5px 7px;border-radius:99px}
.ttime{font:600 10.5px var(--mono);color:var(--mut)}.ttime b{color:var(--txt)}
.volwrap{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:96px}.volwrap input{width:100%}
.waveblock{position:relative}.wl{font:600 8px var(--mono);letter-spacing:1.1px;color:var(--dim);margin:4px 0 2px}
canvas.wave{width:100%;height:36px;display:block;border-radius:6px;background:#0a0f18;border:1px solid var(--line)}
#playhead{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:2px;background:var(--warn);box-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(255,200,87,.8);pointer-events:none;display:none}
#spec{width:100%;height:26px;display:block;border-radius:6px;background:#0a0f18;border:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:5px}
.meterrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-top:5px}
#meter{flex:1;height:10px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#0a0f18;display:block}
#meterTxt{font:600 9px var(--mono);color:var(--dim);min-width:62px;text-align:right}
.anaGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr;gap:3px 9px;font-size:9.5px}
.anaGrid .h{font:600 8.5px var(--mono);letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase;text-align:right}
.anaGrid .l{color:var(--mut)}.anaGrid .v{font:600 9.5px var(--mono);text-align:right}
.anaGrid .v.mas{color:var(--acc)}.anaNote{margin-top:5px;font-size:9px;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.5}
#metaList{max-height:60px;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:#0a0f18;padding:5px 7px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:9px}
.mtag{display:flex;gap:7px;padding:1px 0;color:var(--dim)}.mtag .k{font-family:var(--mono);flex:none}
.mtag s{color:#7d8ea6;text-decoration-color:var(--bad)}
.aihit{color:var(--bad);font-weight:600}.none{color:var(--dim);font-style:italic}
#copPreview{font:600 9px var(--mono);color:var(--acc);margin-top:6px;padding:5px 7px;border:1px dashed rgba(56,225,255,.35);border-radius:7px;background:rgba(56,225,255,.05);line-height:1.5}
#checklist{list-style:none;margin:5px 0 2px}
#checklist li{display:flex;gap:6px;font-size:9px;color:var(--mut);padding:1px 0}
#checklist li .ic{flex:none;font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:700}
#checklist li.ok .ic{color:var(--good)}#checklist li.ok{color:#bfe9d6}
#checklist li.no .ic{color:var(--bad)}#checklist li.pend .ic{color:var(--dim)}
#dirtyChip{display:none;margin-top:5px;font:600 9px/1.4 var(--mono);color:var(--warn);border:1px dashed rgba(255,200,87,.45);border-radius:7px;padding:5px 7px}
.btn-big{width:100%;padding:9px;font-size:12px;border-radius:9px;margin-top:5px}
.sesrow{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-top:5px}
.sesrow input{flex:1;min-width:0}
.sesrow .btn{padding:7px 10px;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}
#overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(4,7,12,.8);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);display:grid;place-items:center;z-index:50}
.ovcard{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:14px;padding:26px 38px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
.bars{display:flex;gap:5px;justify-content:center;height:30px;align-items:flex-end;margin-bottom:12px}
.bars i{width:6px;border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--acc),var(--acc2));animation:bar 1s ease-in-out infinite}
.bars i:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.15s}.bars i:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.3s}.bars i:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.45s}
@keyframes bar{0%,100%{height:7px}50%{height:30px}}
#ovStage{font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;margin-bottom:3px}#ovSub{color:var(--dim);font:9.5px var(--mono)}
#toasts{position:fixed;right:13px;bottom:13px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;z-index:60}
.toast{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-left:3px solid var(--acc);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:11px;max-width:320px;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);animation:tin .25s}
.toast.err{border-left-color:var(--bad)}.toast.ok{border-left-color:var(--good)}
@keyframes tin{from{transform:translateX(30px);opacity:0}}
footer{max-width:1720px;margin:4px auto 0;padding:0 13px;color:#414d61;font-size:9px;line-height:1.6}
/* manual overlay */
#manual{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:70;background:rgba(4,7,12,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}
.mcard{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:15px;max-width:960px;width:100%;max-height:87vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
.mhead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.mhead b{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:2px}
.mhead .btn{margin-left:auto;padding:7px 13px;font-size:11px}
.mbody{overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:hidden;padding:16px 20px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--mut);scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#2a3750 #0a0f18}
.mbody::-webkit-scrollbar{width:7px}
.mbody h2{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--acc);margin:16px 0 7px;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:3px}
.mbody h2:first-child{margin-top:0}
.mbody b{color:var(--txt)}
.mbody table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:7px 0;font-size:10.5px}
.mbody td{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px 8px;vertical-align:top}
.mbody td:first-child{color:var(--txt);font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
.mbody p{margin:5px 0}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px;margin:7px 0}
.step{background:#0e1624;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 9px 8px;position:relative}
.step .n{position:absolute;top:-7px;left:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--acc),var(--acc2));color:#07131d;font:700 10px var(--mono);border-radius:99px;padding:2px 8px}
.step b{display:block;margin:7px 0 2px;font-size:11px;color:var(--txt)}
.step span.s{font-size:10px}
.lgd{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:7px 2px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
.lgd:last-of-type{border-bottom:0}
.lgd .lg{flex:none;width:84px;display:grid;place-items:center}
.lgd .lt b{color:var(--txt)}
.kbd{display:inline-block;font:600 10px var(--mono);background:#0a0f18;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-bottom-width:2px;border-radius:5px;padding:1px 8px;color:var(--lcd);margin:1px}
.tip{background:rgba(56,225,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(56,225,255,.3);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 11px;margin:9px 0}
.warnbx{background:rgba(255,200,87,.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,200,87,.35);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 11px;margin:9px 0}
.cmap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin:7px 0}
.cmaph{grid-column:1/-1;font:700 9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:1.5px;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:5px}
.cmb{background:#0e1624;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:7px;padding:6px 7px;font:600 9px var(--mono);color:var(--mut);text-align:center}
.cmb.w{grid-column:1/-1}
.shape{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px;margin:7px 0}
.scard{background:#0e1624;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px}
.scard .scg{display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:6px;background:#0a0f18;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:6px}
.scard b{display:block;color:var(--txt);font-size:11px;margin-bottom:3px}
.scard .how{font-size:10px;line-height:1.55}
.scard .how em{color:var(--acc);font-style:normal;font-weight:600}
@media (max-width:1480px){.grid{grid-template-columns:184px minmax(0,1fr) 650px}}
@media (max-width:1300px){.grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.gcenter{order:-1}.console{min-height:560px}}
@media (max-width:760px){.tabview{grid-template-columns:1fr}.steps,.shape{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="#07131d" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 12h2M7 8v8M11 4v16M15 7v10M19 10v4"/></svg></div>
  <div class="brand"><b>MASTER BETA</b><small>assistant · tonal balance · lu-matched A/B · watermark guard</small></div>
  <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="btnManual">📖 MANUAL</button>
  <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="btnTopLoad">⬆ LOAD FILE</button>
  <div class="hbadge">◉ 100% LOCAL</div>
  <div class="hbadge" id="bootStat">engine loading…</div>
</header>

<div id="dropWrap">
  <div id="dropZone">
    <div class="dzIcon">🎛️</div>
    <h2>Drop your track here</h2>
    <p>WAV · MP3 · FLAC · AIFF · M4A — decoded, mastered, scrubbed &amp; re-encoded entirely in your browser.</p>
    <div class="btnrow"><button class="btn btn-primary" id="btnBrowse">Choose file</button></div>
  </div>
  <div class="feat"><span>MASTER ASSISTANT</span><span>STUDIO MIC SIM</span><span>TONAL BALANCE</span><span>LU-MATCHED A/B</span><span>WATERMARK GUARD</span></div>
  <input type="file" id="fileIn" accept="audio/*,.wav,.mp3,.flac,.aiff,.aif,.m4a,.ogg" hidden>
</div>

<div id="app" hidden>
  <div class="trackbar">
    <div><div class="tname" id="trackName">—</div><div class="tsub" id="trackSub">—</div></div>
    <div class="tchips">
      <span class="chip" id="chipMeta">metadata: —</span>
      <span class="chip" id="chipLufs">— LUFS in</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="colwrap">
      <div class="card"><h3>AI Repair</h3><div class="pgrid" id="repairGrid"></div></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Genre Presets</h3><div class="pgrid" id="presetGrid"></div></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Session</h3>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-big" id="btnRevert">↩ Revert to saved settings</button>
        <div class="sesrow">
          <input type="text" id="saveName" placeholder="Settings name…">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="btnSave" title="Download [name].masterbeta.json via browser download">⬇</button>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="btnLoadSet" title="Load a saved .json settings file">⬆</button>
        </div>
        <div class="wmnote">⬇ downloads the settings as a .json file to your Downloads folder · ⬆ loads it back · ↩ reverts to the last saved/loaded settings.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="colwrap gcenter">
      <div class="card"><h3>Mastering EQ — live spectrum behind the curve · drag nodes · wheel = Q · dbl-click = reset</h3>
        <canvas id="eqCanvas"></canvas>
        <div class="eqbar">
          <div class="bands" id="eqBands"></div>
          <div class="bctl">
            <select id="selType"><option value="peaking">Peak bell</option><option value="lowshelf">Low shelf</option><option value="highshelf">High shelf</option></select>
            <span>Freq</span><input type="range" id="sEqF" min="20" max="20000" step="10"><span class="val"></span><button class="lbtn" id="bIso" title="Solo-listen this frequency range">ISO</button>
            <span>Gain</span><input type="range" id="sEqG" min="-15" max="15" step="0.1"><span class="val"></span><button class="lbtn" id="bMute">MUTE</button>
            <span>Q</span><input type="range" id="sEqQ" min="0.3" max="12" step="0.05"><span class="val"></span><span style="font-size:7.5px;color:var(--dim)">narrow=iso · wide=mud</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="eqTip">Hover a node…</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><h3>A/B Monitor — keys: space · A / B · L · M (lu-match)</h3>
        <div class="transport">
          <button id="btnPlay">▶</button>
          <div class="seg"><button id="abA" class="on">A · SOURCE</button><button id="abB" disabled>B · LIVE</button></div>
          <button id="btnLoop" class="lbtn">🔁</button>
          <button id="btnLuMatch" class="lbtn" title="Loudness-matched A/B — attenuate B to source loudness so you judge tone, not level.">⚖ LU</button>
          <span id="liveBadge" hidden>⚡ live</span>
          <div class="ttime"><b id="tCur">0:00</b> / <span id="tDur">0:00</span></div>
          <div class="volwrap">🔊<input type="range" id="sVol" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.9"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="waveblock" id="waveWrap">
          <div class="wl">SOURCE</div><canvas class="wave" id="waveA"></canvas>
          <div class="wl">MASTER</div><canvas class="wave" id="waveB"></canvas>
          <div id="playhead"></div>
        </div>
        <canvas id="spec"></canvas>
        <div class="meterrow"><canvas id="meter"></canvas><span id="meterTxt">— dBFS</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Loudness Compliance (BS.1770)</h3>
        <div class="anaGrid">
          <span></span><span class="h">Source</span><span class="h">Mastered</span>
          <span class="l">Integrated loudness</span><span class="v" id="aLufs">—</span><span class="v mas" id="mLufs">—</span>
          <span class="l">True peak</span><span class="v" id="aTp">—</span><span class="v mas" id="mTp">—</span>
          <span class="l">Sample peak</span><span class="v" id="aSpk">—</span><span class="v mas" id="mSpk">—</span>
          <span class="l">Gain applied</span><span class="v">—</span><span class="v mas" id="mGain">—</span>
          <span class="l">Stereo correlation</span><span class="v" id="aCorr">—</span><span class="v mas" id="mCorr">—</span>
        </div>
        <div class="anaNote" id="aNote">Load a track to analyze…</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rcol"><div class="console">
      <div class="tabview" data-t="f">
        <section class="pan wide">
          <div class="panhead"><span class="pled lit"></span>MASTER ASSISTANT</div>
          <div class="assistrow">
            <button class="btn btn-primary" id="btnAssist" disabled>⚡ AUTO-ANALYZE</button>
            <div id="assistOut">Measures shimmer ratio, spectral tilt, stereo correlation, crest — picks the repair tier and sets the chain. Findings printed here.</div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="pan">
          <div class="panhead"><span class="pled" id="pled-clean"></span>CLEANUP</div>
          <div id="pb-clean"></div>
          <div id="depthTxt"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="pan">
          <div class="panhead"><span class="pled lit"></span>TONAL BALANCE &amp; TONE</div>
          <canvas id="tbCv"></canvas>
          <div class="wmnote">9-band deviation vs commercial tilt — amber over · blue under</div>
          <div id="pb-tone"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="pan">
          <div class="panhead"><span class="pled" id="pled-dyn"></span>DYNAMICS</div>
          <div id="pb-dyn"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="pan">
          <div class="panhead"><span class="pled" id="pled-space"></span>IMAGE &amp; SPACE</div>
          <div id="pb-space"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="pan wide">
          <div class="panhead"><span class="pled" id="pled-tex"></span>TEXTURE</div>
          <div id="pb-tex"></div>
        </section>
      </div>
      <div class="tabview" data-t="e" hidden>
        <section class="pan">
          <div class="panhead"><span class="pled" id="pled-out"></span>LOUDNESS &amp; DELIVERABLE</div>
          <div id="pb-out"></div>
          <select id="selFmt" style="margin-top:3px">
            <option value="wav">WAV · 24-bit PCM</option>
            <option value="aiff">AIFF · 24-bit PCM</option>
            <option value="mp3">MP3 · 320 kbps</option>
          </select>
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-big" id="btnProcess" disabled>⚡ MASTER &amp; PREPARE</button>
          <div id="dirtyChip"></div>
          <ul id="checklist"></ul>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-big" id="btnExport" disabled>⬇ EXPORT WAV</button>
        </section>
        <section class="pan">
          <div class="panhead"><span class="pled" id="pled-wm"></span>WATERMARK GUARD</div>
          <div id="pb-wm"></div>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-big" id="btnAudMp3" disabled title="Play the master through a real MP3 320 encode/decode on B. Export unaffected.">🎧 AUDITION MP3</button>
          <div class="wmnote">Resample 44.1↔48k breaks phase/echo codes · lossy round-trip discards low-level detail · WM LPF cuts ultrasonic spread-spectrum energy. Fresh encode drops ID3 · C2PA · iXML · bext. See MANUAL → Watermark Guard for the full guide.</div>
        </section>
        <section class="pan wide">
          <div class="panhead"><span class="pled lit"></span>METADATA &amp; ©</div>
          <div id="metaList"></div>
          <div class="fgrid">
            <div><label>Title</label><input type="text" id="inTitle" placeholder="Track title"></div>
            <div><label>Artist</label><input type="text" id="inArtist" placeholder="Artist"></div>
            <div><label>Album</label><input type="text" id="inAlbum" placeholder="Album / EP"></div>
            <div><label>Year</label><input type="text" id="inYear" placeholder="2025"></div>
            <div><label>© Holder</label><input type="text" id="inHolder" placeholder="Name / Label LLC"></div>
            <div><label>ISRC</label><input type="text" id="inIsrc" placeholder="CC-XXX-YY-NNNNN"></div>
            <div class="full"><label>Publisher</label><input type="text" id="inPub" placeholder="Publisher / PRO"></div>
            <div class="full"><label>Notes</label><textarea id="inComment" placeholder="Liner notes, credits…"></textarea></div>
          </div>
          <div id="copPreview">© …</div>
        </section>
      </div>
      <div class="tabbar">
        <button class="tab on" data-t="f">🎛 FILTERS</button>
        <button class="tab" data-t="e">⬇ EXPORT <span class="tled" id="tabLedE"></span></button>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </div>
  <footer>MASTER BETA — static-safe cleanup, studio mic simulation, pure linear M/S stereo expansion (EXPAND), ±12 dB bass shelf, gain trims, reverb pre-delay, instrumented compressor + GR meters, gentle zero-latency exciter, analog textures, master assistant, tonal balance, loudness-matched A/B, codec preview, watermark guard. Offline master: BS.1770 gated loudness, 4× oversampled true-peak brickwall, TPDF dither, fresh encode, © / ISRC embedded. Settings persist via JSON download/upload.</footer>
</div>

<!-- ============ MANUAL ============ -->
<div id="manual" hidden><div class="mcard">
  <div class="mhead"><b>📖 MASTER BETA HANDBOOK</b><button class="btn btn-ghost" id="mClose">✕ CLOSE</button></div>
  <div class="mbody">

    <h2>Quick Start</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><b>LOAD</b><span class="s">Your track via ⬆ LOAD FILE or drop on the welcome screen. 100% local.</span></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="n">2</span><b>PREVIEW</b><span class="s">Play, press <span class="kbd">B</span> — the whole chain is heard live. Every knob turn is instant.</span></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="n">3</span><b>JUDGE</b><span class="s">Press <span class="kbd">M</span> to loudness-match A/B — compare tone, not volume.</span></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="n">4</span><b>EXPORT</b><span class="s">EXPORT tab → ⚡ MASTER &amp; PREPARE → ⬇ EXPORT. B becomes the true master.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tip"><b>Keyboard:</b> <span class="kbd">space</span> play · <span class="kbd">A</span>/<span class="kbd">B</span> compare · <span class="kbd">L</span> loop · <span class="kbd">M</span> lu-match · <span class="kbd">esc</span> close manual</div>

    <h2>Control Types</h2>
    <div class="lgd"><div class="lg"><svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 44 44"><path d="M9.3 34.7A18 18 0 1 1 34.7 34.7" fill="none" stroke="#1e2c46" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M9.3 34.7A18 18 0 1 1 34.7 34.7" fill="none" stroke="#38e1ff" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="58 100"/><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="12.5" fill="#151f33" stroke="#2a3750" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="21.2" y="9" width="1.6" height="8" rx=".8" fill="#e8f6ff"/></svg></div><div class="lt"><b>Rotary knob</b> — drag up/down to adjust · mouse wheel steps · hold <span class="kbd">shift</span> for fine · double-click resets to default.</div></div>
    <div class="lgd"><div class="lg"><svg width="70" height="18" viewBox="0 0 70 18"><rect x="1" y="5" width="68" height="8" rx="4" fill="#0a0f18" stroke="#22304a"/><rect x="2" y="6" width="37" height="6" rx="3" fill="#38e1ff"/><rect x="35" y="1" width="9" height="16" rx="2" fill="#44557a" stroke="#4a5b7d"/></svg></div><div class="lt"><b>Horizontal fader</b> — drag left/right (V.MIX, D.MIX). Double-click resets.</div></div>
    <div class="lgd"><div class="lg"><svg width="20" height="40" viewBox="0 0 20 40"><circle cx="10" cy="6" r="4" fill="#3ddc97"/><rect x="2" y="12" width="16" height="25" rx="7" fill="#0a0f18" stroke="#2a3750"/><rect x="4.5" y="14.5" width="11" height="11" rx="3" fill="#38e1ff"/></svg></div><div class="lt"><b>Toggle switch</b> — click to engage a module. LED lights green when active.</div></div>
    <div class="lgd"><div class="lg"><svg width="44" height="26" viewBox="0 0 44 26"><rect x="1" y="1" width="42" height="24" rx="7" fill="#121a2b" stroke="#3ddc97" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="13" y="17" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="#3ddc97">U87</text></svg></div><div class="lt"><b>Mic button</b> — click to load that microphone's character into the tonal chain; click again to return to flat. Green glow = active.</div></div>
    <div class="lgd"><div class="lg"><svg width="84" height="16" viewBox="0 0 84 16"><rect x="1" y="3" width="82" height="9" rx="3" fill="#0d1524" stroke="#263350"/><rect x="2" y="4" width="37" height="7" rx="2" fill="#ffc857"/><text x="44" y="11.5" font-family="monospace" font-size="8.5" fill="#8fa0b5">4.2/1.1</text></svg></div><div class="lt"><b>GR meter</b> — gain reduction in dB. LIVE animates while B plays; RENDER shows exact peak/avg of the final master.</div></div>

    <h2>Studio Mic Simulation</h2>
    <p>Six reference microphones modeled as tonal chains: <b>frequency response → proximity warmth (low-shelf) → harmonic saturation character → HPF</b>. Clicking a mic loads its published response curve into the six EQ bands, sets SHINE/WARMTH to its saturation signature (FET, tube, or clean transformerless), and adjusts BRIGHT/TILT/HPF. Then <b>fine-tune any knob on top</b> — the mic is a starting point, not a locked preset.</p>
    <table>
      <tr><td>U87</td><td><b>Neumann U87 Ai</b> — the modern reference. Smooth, balanced, slightly bright with present mids. Broad 5–10 kHz presence lift, gentle low-mid warmth, subtle FET+transformer harmonics. <em>The default "sounds like a record" choice.</em></td></tr>
      <tr><td>C414</td><td><b>AKG C414 XLII</b> — the clean workhorse. Detailed and open: 3–5 kHz presence, air lift above 10 kHz, almost no saturation added (6 dBA self-noise design, transformerless). <em>Use when you want detail without color.</em></td></tr>
      <tr><td>SM7B</td><td><b>Shure SM7B</b> — broadcast warm. Strong low-mid warmth (proximity effect modeled as +2 dB shelf), broad 2–8 kHz presence, highs rolled off above 12 kHz, HPF at 40 Hz. <em>Podcast, rap, rock vocals — tames fizz by design.</em></td></tr>
      <tr><td>U47</td><td><b>Neumann/Telefunken U47</b> — the vintage big vocal. Thick 200–500 Hz body, creamy presence 2–5 kHz, top rolls off above 12 kHz, strong tube even-harmonic saturation (highest WARMTH of the six). <em>Instant vintage thickness.</em></td></tr>
      <tr><td>R121</td><td><b>Royer R-121</b> — ribbon smooth. Warm low end from strong proximity effect, gently dark top with smooth HF roll-off (−4 dB shelf), minimal shine. <em>The fizz-killer: darkens harsh AI highs naturally.</em></td></tr>
      <tr><td>C800G</td><td><b>Sony C-800G</b> — the hip-hop air mic. Hyped shelf above 10 kHz, presence peak, tight sub-bass (−1 dB low shelf), clean tube subtlety. <em>Modern sheen — pairs well with DE-SHIM to add real air after removing fake air.</em></td></tr>
    </table>
    <div class="tip"><b>Workflow:</b> DE-SHIM first (remove fake air) → then add a mic (replace it with charactered air). C800G + Repair·Standard is the classic modern chain; R121 + Repair·Deep for dark-smooth. Mic state is saved in your .masterbeta.json.</div>
    <div class="warnbx"><b>Honest scope:</b> this simulates each mic's <b>tonal response and saturation character</b> on your finished stereo mix. Polar patterns, proximity distance, and self-noise are recording-stage phenomena — patterns are approximated where they affect tone (ribbon darkness, SM7B warmth), noise is deliberately not added (you have TEXTURE for that).</div>

    <h2>Sound-Shaping Graphics Guide</h2>
    <div class="shape">
      <div class="scard"><div class="scg"><svg width="150" height="62" viewBox="0 0 150 62"><line x1="6" y1="48" x2="144" y2="48" stroke="#2a3750" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M6 48 H50 Q62 48 68 34 Q75 18 82 34 Q88 48 100 48 H144" fill="none" stroke="#38e1ff" stroke-width="2.2"/><circle cx="75" cy="20" r="4.5" fill="#ffd9a0" stroke="#0a0f18" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div><b>EQ Node (drag)</b><div class="how">Drag the dot: <em>left/right = frequency, up/down = gain</em>. Wheel narrows the bell (Q). Double-click resets.</div></div>
      <div class="scard"><div class="scg"><svg width="150" height="62" viewBox="0 0 150 62"><rect x="62" y="18" width="26" height="26" rx="4" fill="#151f33" stroke="#38e1ff" stroke-width="1.6"/><text x="69" y="34" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="#38e1ff">M</text><path d="M56 31 H30 M30 31 l7 -4 v8 z" fill="#38e1ff"/><path d="M94 31 H120 M120 31 l-7 -4 v8 z" fill="#38e1ff"/><path d="M20 31 l-8 -6 v12 z M130 31 l8 -6 v12 z" fill="none" stroke="#a78bfa" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></div><b>EXPAND</b><div class="how">Scales the <em>side channel</em> — elements physically move outward in the pan field. ×1.2–1.5 subtle, ×2 dramatic. Pure linear math, no coloration.</div></div>
      <div class="scard"><div class="scg"><svg width="150" height="62" viewBox="0 0 150 62"><line x1="6" y1="48" x2="144" y2="48" stroke="#2a3750" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M6 22 H46 Q64 22 74 40 H144" fill="none" stroke="#38e1ff" stroke-width="2.2"/><path d="M6 44 H46 Q64 44 74 34 H144" fill="none" stroke="#a78bfa" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/></svg></div><b>BASS ±12 dB</b><div class="how">Shelf at 90 Hz. <em>+2 to +4</em> = weight; <em>−2 to −4</em> = tighter low end. Boost with GAIN −2 to keep level.</div></div>
      <div class="scard"><div class="scg"><svg width="150" height="62" viewBox="0 0 150 62"><rect x="62" y="6" width="46" height="52" fill="rgba(255,107,122,.12)"/><path d="M6 40 Q30 26 55 30 Q75 33 85 20 Q95 8 105 22 Q115 34 135 38 Q142 40 144 41" fill="none" stroke="#5d6d84" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M6 42 Q40 40 60 36 Q80 32 90 34 Q100 36 120 42 H144" fill="none" stroke="#38e1ff" stroke-width="2.2"/></svg></div><b>DE-SHIM</b><div class="how">Gray hump = AI fizz. FOCUS centers the dip, INTENS sets depth (1–3 static; 4+ adds slow expander between transients).</div></div>
