    <p>Platform targets: Spotify/YouTube −14 LUFS · Apple −16 · Tidal −12 · SoundCloud −10 · Club −8. Formats: WAV 24-bit (recommended), AIFF 24-bit, MP3 320. MASTER &amp; PREPARE measures BS.1770 integrated loudness and normalizes exactly; TPDF dither for 24-bit.</p>

